SBCS_Snapshot "SBCS_Transition 1..1" -- "SBCS_Snapshot19 1..1" SBCS_Transition : AfterTrans18
SBCS_Snapshot "SBCS_Transition26 1..1" -- "SBCS_Snapshot27 1..1" SBCS_Transition : AfterTrans25
